  (text "COMPONENT LIST (Rev 9):" (at 25.0 155.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "ICs\nU1  STM32G051K6U6  QFN-32    MCU\nU2  AMS1117-3.3    SOT-223   LDO 12-16V -> 3.3V\nGD2 UCC27524       SOT-23-5  Brake gate driver\nGD1 LM321          SOT-23-5  Q1 floating gate driver (WHITE-referenced supply)
ZD1 BZX84C15       SOT-23    15V zener, GD1 floating supply (cathode=WHITE)
U3  CH340N          SOP-8     USB-UART bridge (JLCPCB C506813, no crystal needed)
J_USB HRO TYPE-C-31-M-12      USB-C 16-pin receptacle
D_USB BAT54         SOT-23    VBUS isolation Schottky (anode=VBUS, cathode=LDO_in)
F_USB 500mA polyfuse 0805     VBUS overcurrent protection
R_CC1 5.1k 0402               USB-C CC1 pull-down (UFP identification)
R_CC2 5.1k 0402               USB-C CC2 pull-down
C_USB1 10uF 10V MLCC 0805     VBUS bulk decoupling
C_USB2 100nF 0402             CH340N VCC decoupling
R_Z1 10k 0402               GD1 supply current limiter (WHITE to ZD1 cathode)
C_Z1 100nF 0402             GD1 supply decoupling" (at 25.0 159.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "FETs and Diodes\nQ2  IRLB3034  D2PAK  N-ch brake FET (195A 40V)\nQ1  IRF9Z34N  D2PAK  P-ch keep-alive FET (18A 55V)\nD1  P6KE18CA  SMB    TVS bidirectional — CA suffix ESSENTIAL\nD2  SS310     SMB    Q2 catch diode 100V required\nD3  SS310     SMB    Q1 catch diode 100V required\nD4  MBRS360   SMB    Mode C series protection — most stressed
D5  SS310     SMB    Voltmeter isolation (D_V) — blocks PWM from WHITE rail\nD5  LED Red   0805   Status LED" (at 90.0 159.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "Passives\nF1  500mA-1A polyfuse  1812   WHITE rail MCU supply ONLY\nC1  10uF   0805   LDO input bulk\nC2  100nF  0402   LDO input HF\nC3  10uF   0805   LDO output bulk\nC4  100nF  0402   LDO output HF\nC5  100nF  0402   MCU VDD decouple\nC6  100nF  0402   MCU VDDA decouple\nC7   4u7    0402   MCU VDDA bulk
C_VM 100uF  SMD    Voltmeter RC filter cap (with R_VM 10k, tau=1s)" (at 155.0 159.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "Resistors\nR1   10k  0402  NRST pull-up\nR2   10k  0402  GD2 safe-default (on INPUT not gate)\nR3   10R  0402  Q2 gate\nR4   10R  0402  Q1 gate\nR5   10k  0402  Pot reference to 3.3V\nR6   10k  0402  Capture btn pull-up\nR7   1k   0402  Capture btn series\nR8   18k  0402  WHITE sense top divider\nR9   4k7  0402  WHITE sense bottom\nR10  22k  0402  BLACK sense top divider\nR11  4k7  0402  BLACK sense bottom\nR12  330R 0402  Status LED
R_W  10k  0402  Voltmeter series — WHITE rail to J14 pin1
R_VM 10k  0402  PWM RC filter (with C_VM 100uF) on PB4->voltmeter signal" (at 205.0 159.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "Connectors\nJ1-J6  4mm banana  Track WHITE/BLACK/RED (x2 sides)\nJ7     3-pin 2.54mm  Mode toggle A/B/C\nJ8     2-pin 2.54mm  Capture button\nJ9     2-pin 4mm     Track output\nJ10    4-pin 2.54mm  SWD: SWDIO/SWDCLK/GND/+3V3\nJ11    3-pin 2.54mm  UART: TX/RX/GND  115200 8N1\nJ12    2-pin 2.54mm  BOOT0 button (ROM bootloader)\nJ13    2-pin 2.54mm  NRST button
J14    3-pin 2.54mm  Voltmeter: Pin1=Vin(sig), Pin2=GND, Pin3=Vcc" (at 25.0 195.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
  (text "KEY DESIGN NOTES:
D_PG (pass gate) is in BLACK controller path, NOT WHITE rail.
D1 TVS is on WHITE rail (transient clamp only).
Black sense point (PA1) is on MOTOR SIDE of D_PG." (at 115.0 195.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold)))
  (text "Q2 TIM3_CH1 INVERTED polarity: CCR=0 = FET ON = dead short\nR2 pull-up on GD2 INPUT (not Q2 gate) = safe default brake at power-off\nD4 ESSENTIAL in mode C: blocks reverse current into Q1 during hard braking\nF1 in WHITE rail ONLY — never in BLACK track path (40A motor startup)\nD1 P6KE18CA — bidirectional variant — clamps both polarity transients\nD2/D3 SS310 100V — inductive turn-off spikes on 16V rail need 100V rating" (at 115.0 199.0 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)))
)
